{
 "id": 1793529,
 "titulo": "6/27 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1687849306379,
 "modificada": 1741863513902,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1793529",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1642484088451\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb6d1abccb364a5981c9cb4a33768459_1642484088451_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We introduce these two men who hunt their enemies<br>\nwith sharp attacks and bodies that regenerate endlessly!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Wolverine </span>has become Omega Wolverine&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">with his new Uniform and Tier-4.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Sabretooth </span>will show the brutality of the wild&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">with his new Uniform and Tier-3.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nAgents, check out their new skills and power<br>\nby downloading the 6/27 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 6/27 Patch Details</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 6/28 (Wed) 2:46 (UTC+0), 6/27 (Tue) 19:46 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[6/28 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 6/27 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of 6/28 (Wed) 2:45 (UTC+0), 6/27 (Tue) 19:45 (PDT).&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">the completion time will be announced</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> once the patch has been finished.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, and the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Two New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Two new Uniforms, Wolverine &lt;X Deaths of Wolverine&gt;&nbsp;<br>\nand Sabretooth &lt;Ultimate&gt; have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 6/27 Patch data has been applied.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can be found and purchased in the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room.<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats.<br>\n(Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6) &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1690\" id=\"1687834946441\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/55e662e71c534f7cb581749c5922f9a2_1687834946441_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1389\" id=\"1687834946457\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f1f9993241fc4a2680b9e97647074495_1687834946457_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Wolverine Tier-4</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Wolverine is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nWolverine is ready to be outraged to protect the order anytime when needed.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"281\" id=\"1687834984769\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/dad1169b77f54afda2998c72d0aad093_1687834984769_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Sabretooth Tier-3</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Sabretooth is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.<br>\nBe aware of the haunt of the beast with a hunger for brutality.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"413\" id=\"1687835015488\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b17366fe47c94c378feadfb0ceb7ccef_1687835015488_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1687835046741\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/2ec3596478b540fe8e91246554e33d57_1687835046741.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New Artifacts</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">​<br>\nA new Artifact has been added for Sabretooth.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"352\" id=\"1687844327771\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6a7ca4e27c2a43bc82dbe70ee8826189_1687844327771_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Some unlock challenge&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;for specific stages of&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">World Boss: Legend &lt;Kang the Conquerer&gt; have been changed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Clear within 150 seconds → Clear within 180 seconds<br>\n- Clear within 100 seconds → Clear within 150 seconds</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. The Daily / Weekly Otherworld Battle challenges have been changed.</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- (Daily) Win in Otherworld Battle with all characters at 70% HP or higher 1 time<br>\n→ Win in Otherworld Battle with all characters at 50% HP or higher 1 time<br>\n- (Weekly) Win in Otherworld Battle with all characters at 70% HP or higher 5 times<br>\n→ Win in Otherworld Battle with all characters at 50% HP or higher 5 times</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The maximum point of the Challenger League being displayed as 5,500 at the&nbsp;<br>\nMy League Info pop-up after the beginning of Otherworld Battle Season 2 has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1687834816607\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/dad695a759b8476591fd2ad7e65f7da1_1687834816607_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
}